Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.67,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我  我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.26,0:00:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  白河同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  露娜要做的话我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妮可你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.35,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打工  这次PASS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…那…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那  那我也愿意做…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一个人  还有人自愿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好  这时候就…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我推荐伊地知同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…伊地知同学?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.81,0:01:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我也愿意…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢我吧  朋友
Comment: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:06.07,0:01:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:01:50.15,0:01:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:01:55.91,0:01:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:15.01,0:02:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:16.43,0:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
